### I01 malformed email (no attachments) → 400 with issue paths
POST {{base}}/api/webhooks/email
Content-Type: application/json

< ./fixtures/payloads/ingestion/i01-email-missing-attachments.json

### I05 WhatsApp media that cannot be fetched → 200, document FAILED (MEDIA_UNAVAILABLE)
POST {{base}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

< ./fixtures/payloads/ingestion/i05-whatsapp-unknown-media.json

### B2 — the card feed delivers S05's transaction late → S05 re-matched to MATCHED (send S05 first)
POST {{base}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "feed-T16",
  "clientId": 1,
  "cardId": 3,
  "driverPhone": "+966554445566",
  "merchantName": "SAHARA AUTO SVC RUH",
  "mcc": "7538",
  "amount": 34000,
  "transactionAt": "2025-06-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### B5 — Meta's subscription handshake → 200 "1158201444" when WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=verify-me, else 403
GET {{base}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.verify_token=verify-me&hub.challenge=1158201444

### B5 — with WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET set, an unsigned delivery → 401 MISSING_SIGNATURE (signed: npm run demo:webhooks)
POST {{base}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "entry": [] }
